<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home KisanMitra AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./includes/navbar') %>
    <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
         <div class="intro-content">
            <h1>Welcome to KisanMitra AI</h1>
            <h2> Hello <%= user.name %> </h2>
            <h3>The future of your agriculture with AI</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1> Smarter Farming Starts Here. </h1>
          <h2> The right information, the right guidance, right when you need it. </h2>
          <p> KisaanMitra brings the power of AI and agricultural technology closer to farmers. Whether you need help identifying a crop problem, understanding weather conditions, exploring government schemes, checking market information, or simply have a question about farming, KisaanMitra is here to guide you. Everything is designed with one purpose — to make farming information simpler, decisions smarter, and every farmer more confident. </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
           <a href="/chat" class="btn">talk to KisaanMitra</a>
          <a href="/about" class="btn"> view Features </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-images">
        <img src="/images/Homeintroimg.jpg" alt="Hero Image" class="hero-image">
        <img src="/images/Homeintroimg2.jpg" alt="AI Image" class="ai-image">
        <img src="/images/Homeintroimg3.jpg" alt="AI Image" class="ai-image2">
        <img src="/images/Homeintroimg1.jpg" alt="AI Image" class="ai-image3">
      </div>
    </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('./includes/footer') %>
</body>
</html>


